<edge source="E:Concept:explainable_ai" target="E:Property:trust_in_ai_systems" id="0">
  <data key="d4">PART_OF</data>
  <data key="d5">KDJ-AI-2026E1-P04-C29-S02-47F6E198</data>
  <data key="d6">source</data>
  <data key="d7">NIST-IR-8312::P0008::SEC1::B0040</data>
  <data key="d8">Explainable AI is one of several properties that characterize trust in AI systems</data>
</edge>
<edge source="E:Concept:explainable_ai" target="E:Concept:trustworthy_ai" id="0">
  <data key="d4">RELATED_TO</data>
  <data key="d5">KDJ-AI-2026E1-P04-C29-S02-47F6E198</data>
  <data key="d6">source</data>
  <data key="d7">NIST-IR-8312::P0008::SEC1::B0039</data>
  <data key="d8">It is also motivated by the desire to create trustworthy AI</data>
</edge>
<edge source="E:Concept:explainable_ai" target="E:Concept:ai_system" id="0">
  <data key="d4">APPLIES_TO</data>
  <data key="d5">KDJ-AI-2026E1-P04-C29-S02-47F6E198</data>
  <data key="d6">source</data>
  <data key="d7">NIST-IR-8312::P0008::SEC1::B0038</data>
  <data key="d8">artificial intelligence (AI) systems contribute to a diagnosis, they could support good bedside manners</data>
</edge>
<edge source="E:Concept:explainable_ai" target="E:Risk:risk" id="0">
  <data key="d4">MITIGATES</data>
  <data key="d5">KDJ-AI-2026E1-P04-C29-S05-814FDB95</data>
  <data key="d6">source</data>
  <data key="d7">NIST-IR-8312::P0015::SEC4::B0088</data>
  <data key="d8">Explainable AI can mitigate the risks of artificial intelligence by assessing, measuring, or predicting the risk.</data>
</edge>
<edge source="E:Concept:explainable_ai" target="E:Attack:adversarial_attack" id="0">
  <data key="d4">CAUSES</data>
  <data key="d5">KDJ-AI-2026E1-P04-C29-S05-814FDB95</data>
  <data key="d6">source</data>
  <data key="d7">NIST-IR-8312::P0015::SEC4::B0088</data>
  <data key="d8">explainable AI can introduce risks of its own, e.g., adversarial attacks discussed in Section 6.3.</data>
</edge>
<edge source="E:Concept:explainable_ai" target="E:Concept:interpretability" id="0">
  <data key="d4">RELATED_TO</data>
  <data key="d5">KDJ-AI-2026E1-P04-C29-S06-EC2CC32F</data>
  <data key="d6">source</data>
  <data key="d7">NIST-IR-8312::P0018::SEC5::B0111</data>
