<edge source="E:Concept:explanation" target="E:Publication:nist_ir_8312" id="1">
  <data key="d4">DEFINED_IN</data>
  <data key="d5">KDJ-AI-2026E1-P04-C29-S03-D7F773D3</data>
  <data key="d6">source</data>
  <data key="d7"></data>
  <data key="d8"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="E:Concept:explanation" target="E:Publication:nist_ir_8312" id="2">
  <data key="d4">DEFINED_IN</data>
  <data key="d5">KDJ-AI-2026E1-P04-C29-S03-D7F773D3</data>
  <data key="d6">source</data>
  <data key="d7">NIST-IR-8312::P0009::SEC2::B0047</data>
  <data key="d8">An explanation is the evidence, support, or reasoning related to a system's output or process.</data>
</edge>
<edge source="E:Concept:explanation" target="E:Publication:nist_ir_8312" id="3">
  <data key="d4">REFERENCES</data>
  <data key="d5">KDJ-AI-2026E1-P04-C29-S05-814FDB95</data>
  <data key="d6">source</data>
  <data key="d7"></data>
  <data key="d8"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="E:Concept:explanation" target="E:Publication:nist_ir_8312" id="4">
  <data key="d4">REFERENCES</data>
  <data key="d5">KDJ-AI-2026E1-P04-C29-S10-CDFE093D</data>
  <data key="d6">source</data>
  <data key="d7"></data>
  <data key="d8"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="E:Concept:explanation" target="E:Framework:four_principles_of_explainable_ai" id="0">
  <data key="d4">PART_OF</data>
  <data key="d5">KDJ-AI-2026E1-P04-C29-S03-D7F773D3</data>
  <data key="d6">source</data>
  <data key="d7">NIST-IR-8312::P0009::SEC2::B0049</data>
  <data key="d8">Explanation: A system delivers or contains accompanying evidence or reason(s) for outputs and/or processes.</data>
</edge>
<edge source="E:Concept:explanation" target="E:Framework:four_principles_of_explainable_ai" id="1">
  <data key="d4">PART_OF</data>
  <data key="d5">KDJ-AI-2026E1-P04-C29-S10-CDFE093D</data>
  <data key="d6">source</data>
  <data key="d7">NIST-IR-8312::P0028::SEC9::B0175</data>
  <data key="d8">the system produce an explanation, that the explanation be meaningful to humans</data>
</edge>
<edge source="E:Concept:explanation" target="E:Concept:four_principles_of_explainable_ai" id="0">
  <data key="d4">PART_OF</data>
  <data key="d5">KDJ-AI-2026E1-P04-C29-S05-814FDB95</data>
  <data key="d6">source</data>
  <data key="d7">NIST-IR-8312::P0016::SEC4::B0091</data>
  <data key="d8">An explanation, the first principle, is necessary for explainable AI.</data>
</edge>
<edge source="E:Concept:explanation" target="E:Risk:intellectual_property_exposure" id="0">
  <data key="d4">CAUSES</data>
  <data key="d5">KDJ-AI-2026E1-P04-C29-S05-814FDB95</data>
  <data key="d6">source</data>
  <data key="d7">NIST-IR-8312::P0016::SEC4::B0091</data>
  <data key="d8">A potential negative outcome of having an explanation is the exposure of proprietary details.</data>
</edge>
<edge source="E:Concept:explanation" target="E:LegalConcept:fcra" id="0">
  <data key="d4">SUPPORTED_BY</data>
  <data key="d5">KDJ-AI-2026E1-P04-C29-S05-814FDB95</data>
  <data key="d6">source</data>
  <data key="d7">NIST-IR-8312::P0016::SEC4::B0092</data>
  <data key="d8">Explanations may also be necessary for compliance with regulations, e.g., The Fair Credit Reporting Act (FCRA).</data>
</edge>
<edge source="E:Concept:explanation" target="E:LegalConcept:gdpr_article_13" id="0">
  <data key="d4">SUPPORTED_BY</data>
  <data key="d5">KDJ-AI-2026E1-P04-C29-S05-814FDB95</data>
  <data key="d6">source</data>
  <data key="d7">NIST-IR-8312::P0016::SEC4::B0092</data>
  <data key="d8">Article 13 of the European Union General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).</data>
</edge>
<edge source="E:Concept:explanation" target="E:Concept:trust_in_system" id="0">
  <data key="d4">CAUSES</data>
  <data key="d5">KDJ-AI-2026E1-P04-C29-S05-814FDB95</data>
  <data key="d6">source</data>
  <data key="d7">NIST-IR-8312::P0016::SEC4::B0092</data>
  <data key="d8">This could lead to improvements, such as increased trust in the system.</data>
</edge>
<edge source="E:Concept:explanation" target="E:OrganizationalRole:developers_and_auditors" id="0">
  <data key="d4">AFFECTS</data>
