  <data key="d5">KDJ-AI-2026E1-P04-C30-S03-290936FF</data>
  <data key="d6">source</data>
  <data key="d7">NIST-IR-8367::P0019::SEC2.1::B0096</data>
  <data key="d8">Humans also encode verbatim mental representations, which are simply detailed representations of the stimulus itself</data>
</edge>
